      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, witness clauses",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>The slave recognizes the validity of this.</li>\n<li>Written by Hil\u0101l ibn B\u016b \u02bfAl\u012b on its date.</li>\n<li>The slave recognizes the validity of this.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Written by B\u016b Sa\u02bfd ibn S\u0101lim on [its date].</li>\n<li>The slave reports that the people who attached their signatures hereto</li>\n<li>are all elders of the Jews whose word can be trusted. Their word is accordingly valid</li>\n<li>and sound in my opinion. Written by D\u0101\u02be\u016bd son of the \u1e25\u0101kim Ibr\u0101h\u012bm ibn M\u016bs\u0101,&nbsp;</li>\n<li>head of the Jews.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
